      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Kalo Brick and Tile Company, Iowa’s largest early‑20th‑century plant, produced up to 50,000 tons of brick annually and employed 65 to 100 workers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
